WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:32.623
"Look!" Dipper said.

2
00:00:32.623 --> 00:00:36.339
"There's a picture in the box."

3
00:00:36.339 --> 00:00:39.513
The picture showed a road.

4
00:00:39.513 --> 00:00:46.841
An X was next to it.

5
00:00:46.842 --> 00:00:49.502
"Oh!" Eddy said.

6
00:00:49.503 --> 00:00:53.700
"We're going to drive off-road."

7
00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:57.031
"How do you know?" Jeb said.

8
00:00:57.032 --> 00:01:00.170
"See the X?" Eddy said.

9
00:01:00.171 --> 00:01:04.745
"It is off the road."

10
00:01:04.746 --> 00:01:08.412
"You're smart, Eddy," Poppy said.

11
00:01:08.413 --> 00:01:13.018
"So where do we go?" Gasser asked.

12
00:01:13.018 --> 00:01:16.439
"Where can we drive off-road?"

13
00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:20.976
"In the woods," Eddy said.

14
00:01:20.976 --> 00:01:37.313
"Follow me!"

15
00:01:37.313 --> 00:01:54.937
Everyone drove along the trail.

16
00:01:54.938 --> 00:01:59.039
They came to a stop sign.

17
00:01:59.039 --> 00:02:02.342
Eddy looked around.

18
00:02:02.343 --> 00:02:08.515
He didn't see any clues.

19
00:02:08.516 --> 00:02:12.361
Honk! Poppy honked the horn.

20
00:02:12.362 --> 00:02:15.192
Suddenly—Honk, honk!

21
00:02:15.192 --> 00:02:24.515
Someone honked back!

22
00:02:24.515 --> 00:02:31.052
"It's Mr. Grill!" Dipper cried.

23
00:02:31.053 --> 00:02:35.013
"Good job, everyone," Mr. Grill said.

24
00:02:35.014 --> 00:02:42.951
"You found me!"
